{"author":"did:key:z6Mkmz8SWiUshwDMszSqwzMngt7ScNmsEj7vZoFRLjpcZTm9","evaluation":{"digest":{"sha256":"1f161208c51799156658decc6488f12efb0659d9b2148b2292a313616ac29f87"}},"instructions":"Return exactly ACCEPT or REJECT.","network.jinn.binary-judgment.item-sha256":"sha256:b0f17b45bb12ad791fc09ddaaa3b537fafa97b759210ccb9dcfc9627620a705a","outputs":[{"mediaType":"text/plain; charset=utf-8","name":"judge-response","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.jinn.binary-judgment.observation.v1+json","name":"judge-observation","required":true},{"mediaType":"application/vnd.inspect-ai.eval-log+json","name":"inspect-log","required":false}],"payload":{"candidateAnswer":"Various meaningful items from people she cares about","evidence":"[D2:7 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Deborah: It is love, and openness that have kept us close all these years. Being there for each other has made us both happy. Look what letter I received yesterday!\n[D2:9 | 9:49 am on 27 January, 2023] Deborah: The group members sent this to me! They thanked me for the positive influence I had on them. Those moments remind me why I'm so passionate about yoga.\n[D4:26 | 9:48 am on 4 February, 2023] Deborah: That's a really powerful message. It reminds me of someone special and their grace and strength when they faced hardships. Check out this creation!\n[D23:20 | 11:46 am on 30 August, 2023] Deborah: Exploring historical places and learning their stories is so fun. It was a great experience. I want to share this photo with you.\n[D23:22 | 11:46 am on 30 August, 2023] Deborah: This was written to me by a friend who, unfortunately, will never be able to support me. I miss him here. This quote says\"Let go of what no longer serves you.\"","itemId":"urn:uuid:1de8732c-a87c-5bad-8e36-362fc19d9e36","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:b424143e1b4201522b36f827a0f7e649c59baa5abd3282abb8c6e90b0177619a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"What gifts has Deborah received?","referenceAnswer":"an appreciate letter from her community, a flower bouqet from her friend, a motivational quote from a friend","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"b424143e1b4201522b36f827a0f7e649c59baa5abd3282abb8c6e90b0177619a"}}]},"profile":{"digest":{"sha256":"ebb34d8362e2cc3135847a5ad6f3ee3d9c2d9922a2b827aa9dfcbaf440b22557"},"uri":"https://spec.jinn.network/task-profiles/binary-judgment/2.0"},"protocol":"https://spec.jinn.network/profiles/task-execution/v1"}